B.fmP=new A.ei("Added: Project analytics, with a forecast finish date, the burn-up chart, money, time and expense breakdowns, and a health score.",B.aZ)
B.fmw=new A.ei("Added: A Documents list on the main menu with every file uploaded to the company, to preview, download, rename, make public or private, and delete.",B.aZ)
B.fmM=new A.ei("Added: Custom fields on line items, bulk update for tasks, expenses and recurring invoices, Check VAT and PEPPOL delivery on clients, and comments and logged calls on tasks and projects.",B.aZ)
B.fmC=new A.ei("Added: Custom labels now apply throughout the app, not just on documents [#84](https://github.com/invoiceninja/flutter/issues/84)",B.aZ)
B.fnQ=new A.ei("Added: F-Droid builds, reproducible and signed by Invoice Ninja [#175](https://github.com/invoiceninja/flutter/issues/175)",B.qe)
B.fnm=new A.ei("Added: Get the phone app from the desktop app or the web: scan a QR code, or tap a store button in a phone's browser.",B.OX)
B.fmA=new A.ei("Added: When a self-hosted server's certificate is refused, sign-in explains why and lets you trust that exact certificate.",B.aZ)
B.fmF=new A.ei('Updated: Smarter list search. It finds clients, vendors and projects not loaded yet, understands periods like "this month", keeps your search when you add a filter, reads pasted queries, and says when archived records are hidden, with Show archived under the last row.',B.aZ)
B.fnd=new A.ei('Updated: Settings search opens the tab that holds the field and highlights it, and finds a section by its name or a keyword like "smtp" or "2fa".',B.aZ)
B.fmD=new A.ei("Updated: A Compact list density, totals for selected rows, faster invoice editing, line breaks in line item descriptions, an API token's full value on its Edit screen, and saved invoices and quotes show the server's PDF, signatures included.",B.aZ)
B.fmT=new A.ei("Fixed: A delivered email no longer shows the red bounced badge.",B.aZ)
B.fni=new A.ei("Fixed: Starting or stopping a timer on a task you can't edit no longer signs you out, the sign-in screen says why a session ended, and on the web you're warned before an idle sign-out.",B.aZ)
B.fng=new A.ei("Fixed: Very large amounts no longer lose cents when shown [#176](https://github.com/invoiceninja/flutter/issues/176)",B.aZ)
